*> vybe-test: cobol/collating_sequence/collating_sequence_in_special_names_and_currency_runtime
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_collating_sequence.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COLL13.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SPECIAL-NAMES.
    ALPHABET MY-COLLATE IS STANDARD-2.
    COLLATING SEQUENCE IS MY-COLLATE.
    CURRENCY SIGN IS "$".
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 AMT PIC $99.99 VALUE $12.34.
01 TOTAL PIC $99.99 VALUE $0.00.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE AMT TO TOTAL
    IF TOTAL > 0 DISPLAY "CURR_COLL" END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "CURR_COLL" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "CURR_COLL"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [CURR_COLL] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

